{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/498296-life-after-majesty","id":498296,"title":"life after majesty","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-30T22:21:05-07:00","id":498296,"title":"life after majesty","content":"What do you guys do with the victims of Majesty after the effect wears off. I mean it isnt like Dominate were the person forgets everything and its not a switch that you turn love-dont love, the target still remembers the feelings he had so how do you handle those lingering affections.<br /> Would you say that a constant victim of charm and enthrall should start to belive that those feelings are real and develop a permanent condition?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T03:25:50-07:00","id":498589,"title":"","content":"Too much is dependent on the situation. Too much is situation dependent. Generally speaking, I would allow Majesty to affect the initial impression someone has of you for Social Maneuvers, but nothing else. I'd have most people feel like they were &quot;caught up in the moment.&quot;<br /> <br /> If you want someone to feel permanent attachment, then that's what Social Maneuvering is for! <br /> <br /> I liken Majesty a bit to gravity or magnets, drawing people towards you, not projecting anything out. With the magnetic pull turned off, there's no pull, so those attached fall away without putting extra, outside effort into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 05-01-2015, 06:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T04:22:43-07:00","id":498608,"title":"","content":"And there are specific devotions which grant those conditions as persistent ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T07:08:21-07:00","id":500272,"title":"","content":"That's actually a very interesting question.<br /> <br /> While I agree that Majesty, especially at lower levels, is more a modifier to social abilities than a social ability in and of itself, it's an interesting idea that someone repeatedly exposed to Majesty might think they've fallen in love with the Majester. While I would normally agree that, yes, causing that effect is the result of Majesty-empowered Social rolls, having it happen when you don't want it to might make for an interesting plot hook. . .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/4411-my-geist-gmc-updates\" target=\"_blank\">My Geist GMC Updates</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/4348-my-infinite-macabre-goodies\" target=\"_blank\">My Infinite Macabre Goodies</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/4372-parasite-eve-the-third-birthday-chronicle\" target=\"_blank\">Parasite Eve: The Third Birthday Chronicle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/899558-shamelessly-pimping-my-book\" target=\"_blank\">Shamelessly pimping my book</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/831-erikmodi","name":"ErikModi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T08:03:32-07:00","id":500353,"title":"","content":"I tend to shy away from slapping players with unwanted consequences of successfully using their powers, at least like this. <br /> <br /> It's an interesting idea, and there's merit to it, but having had the experience where using Majesty on an NPC just one time created a Fatal Attraction sort of situation... Let me tell you, it's not fun, and it makes you feel like you're being punished for using disciplines.<br /> <br /> Just be careful not to make it feel like a punishment for nothing more than using a power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/689-smarmy-vamp","name":"Smarmy Vamp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T15:01:45-07:00","id":500798,"title":"","content":"Not to mention that there's plenty of other things in the Daeva skill set that do similar. Kiss of the Succubus for addictive bites, for one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T17:41:57-07:00","id":501022,"title":"","content":"That sort of thing seems to be exactly what Kiss of the Succubus is for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T22:01:40-07:00","id":501361,"title":"","content":"Kiss of the succubus creates an addiction, thats not what im thinking about. I get about the power being something like a magnet but the people affected still remember what they felt and that should change the way they act. Lets look at it from another way, If a Nosferatu use Nigthmare and sacres the shit out of somebody the next nigth he is not going to meet that person and be all like &quot;man you sure scare me last nigth, y almost got hit by a car. So did you see the game?&quot;. He is probably going to be pretty scared even if the effect of Nigthmare wore off and the vampire isnt using the Discipline again. So something like that should be true for Majesty too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1351,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","user":"Sakii","date":". 05-03-2015, 01:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T06:16:23-07:00","id":501627,"title":"","content":"Like I said, it can alter one's Impression on the Social Maneuvering chart on a permanent basis. I think that's a fair benefit for what you are describing. Grant the Conditions permanently? No. It overlaps with the Kiss and the Vinculum too much for me to really consider it a viable alternative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T06:48:10-07:00","id":501640,"title":"","content":"Nightmare - second time meeting you're still sorta scared of him becausey ou know what might happen.<br /> Majesty - second time meeting you might be exoeting the rush of feeling a &quot;crush&quot; towards him, and thus social maneuvering chart is a perfect representation for that...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T13:06:09-07:00","id":502067,"title":"","content":"&quot;Uhm, so, about last night?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Yeah?</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I don't usually... do that. Take somebody home.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>It's pretty new to me, too.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;We didn't... sleep together, did we?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>Only literally.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Okay, good.&quot; *pause* &quot;That was awkward to ask.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>It was awkward to answer. Look... you want to get dinner Thursday?</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, okay. I mean. Sounds good.&quot; <div align=\"right\">--actual play</div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> It really depends on the context. If you get affected by Majesty, you'll probably rationalize it:<br /> <br /> &quot;I was lonely.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;He was funny.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;She was really on fire last night.&quot;<br /> <br /> Depending on what you did under the effects, you may think you were being dumb and be too embarrassed or annoyed to want to associate with the vampire. Or, you may remember it as a good time, and even though you don't feel the same crush or trust or whatever that you did last night, you remember it and are more likely to be friendly to the vampire.<br /> <br /> If you've frequently experienced Majesty, you're likely to have some weird feelings:<br /> <br /> &quot;Some nights I need to let go.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Dunno why, but around her I completely lose it.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;He's a guilty pleasure.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without Majesty, you probably vary on how you respond, depending on what else is going on. You might seek the vampire out, because you know you like their company. You may avoid them, because you know you do stupid shit when they ask.<br /> <br /> It's also worth noting that since the bigger powers build on Awe, other people you're with are likely to back up your impressions of the vampire:<br /> <br /> &quot;You've got a thing. I can kinda understand it, but it's a thing.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, he was hot in those jeans.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Her bullshit always sounds profound until you actually think about it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 05-03-2015, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T15:25:15-07:00","id":502225,"title":"","content":"I like to imagine Majesty as the ability to make onlookers and listeners gloss over your receding hairline and nasally voice. It also has the power to draw attention to and magnify your better features; suddenly your nice smile becomes the sweetest smile. Dangerous suggestions become adventurous. A small compliment or nice gesture becomes genuinely heartfelt.<br /> <br /> Do you ever meet up with someone and they just seem less attractive or more attractive at different times? Do you ever get talked into things that seem innocuous at the time (only to be awful ideas in hindsight)? That's how I consider Majesty's long-term effects on the average person (nobody will pay much mind, they won't automatically think supernatural powers are at work). Using Majesty, a vampire could talk someone previously afraid of riding a motorbike into giving it a go (normally they would be too nervous and say 'no', but Majesty makes the suggestion difficult to reject). The person isn't going to forget that they conquered a fear and probably look at it with a measure of pride and self-assurance. They would probably be braver about riding a motorbike without any supernatural interference in the future as a result. I don't think people are inclined to necessarily think all out-of-character behaviour on their part is a mistake. They might see it as a learning curve, a bit of life experience, or a life-altering epiphany.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I don't normally take somebody home. But he was so charming.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Was he cute?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Did you have fun?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah... I did...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Did he give you his number?&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1592,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1592-jack","user":"Jack","date":". 05-03-2015, 06:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1592-jack","name":"Jack","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1592_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T08:53:26-07:00","id":510739,"title":"","content":"then MCN suggestion of using the impression from Social Maneuvering is the best chooise. And this makes Daevas more terrifing if they are using majesty when they are doing something legit instead of tying to look like the best looking person while looking like a clown since they can go from zero to love in the first meeting without no one suspecting anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}